{"name":"Ecosystem","hex":"#a8916c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"ecosystem","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A system formed by an ecological community and its environment that functions as a unit.","The interconnectedness of organisms (plants, animals, microbes) with each other and their environment."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ecosystem"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ecosystem","blocks":[{"text":"An ecosystem is a system formed by organisms in interaction with their environment, where the biotic and abiotic components are linked together through nutrient cycles and energy flows."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Blue_Linckia_Starfish.JPG/330px-Blue_Linckia_Starfish.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ecosystem","wikidata":"Q37813"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HohRiverTrail_7322.jpg/500px-HohRiverTrail_7322.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HohRiverTrail_7322.jpg/500px-HohRiverTrail_7322.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHohRiverTrail_7322.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/River_gambia_Niokolokoba_National_Park.gif/500px-River_gambia_Niokolokoba_National_Park.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/River_gambia_Niokolokoba_National_Park.gif/500px-River_gambia_Niokolokoba_National_Park.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Rainforest ecosystems are rich in biodiversity. This is the Gambia River in Senegal's Niokolo-Koba National Park.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki